    {
      "id": 27042,
      "name": {
        "full": "Wekapipo",
        "native": "ウェカピポ",
        "alternative": []
      },
      "description": "Wekapipo is an exiled Neapolitan and a practitioner of the Spin. He wields a special type of steel ball called Wrecking Ball.\n\nAfter serving as a royal guard for the Kingdom of Naples, Wekapipo was forced into exile and later entered the service of the current President of the United States, Funny Valentine. He, alongside Magent Magent, become amongst those sent to assassinate Johnny Joestar and Gyro Zeppeli for possession of the Saint's Corpse. He now works with the President to get the corpse parts and kill Gyro and Johnny in return for citizenship and residence in the United States, as well as a high ranking position in the government.",
